ocumentation and engineering support—built for professional teams and tight schedules.</span>","content_type":"text","element_id":"work-desc"},{"content_value":"<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Professional submittals, data sheets, testing,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0.2px;\">and guidance—ready for review.</span>","content_type":"text","element_id":"work-step-3-desc"},{"content_value":"<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Send plans, geotechnical reports, conditions&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0.2px;\">and constraints to our team.</span>","content_type":"text","element_id":"work-step-1-desc"},{"content_value":"<span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: rgb(255, 252, 253);\">Share Project Details</span>","content_type":"text","element_id":"work-step-1-title"},{"content_value":"<span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: rgb(247, 243, 244);\">Support Installation</span>","content_type":"text","element_id":"work-step-4-title"},{"content_value":"<span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\">Engineer The Solution</span>","content_type":"text","element_id":"work-step-2-title"},{"content_value":"<span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: rgb(241, 240, 240);\">Deliver Documentation</span>","content_type":"text","element_id":"work-step-3-title"},{"content_value":"<span style=\"color: inherit; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: inherit; font-style: italic;\">WHY CHOOSE BASELOK</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\"></span></span><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 16px;\"></span>","content_type":"text","element_id":"why-sub"},{"content_value":"<li style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);padding:5px 0;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;\"><span style=\"color:#c8102e;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\">●</span><span>Design &amp; evaluate pavement, rail, and foundation sections</span></li>\n                <li style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);padding:5px 0;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;\"><span style=\"color:#c8102e;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\">●</span><span>Instantly compare reinforced vs. unreinforced costs</span></li>\n                <li style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);padding:5px 0;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;\"><span style=\"color:#c8102e;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\">●</span><span>Generate exportable reports for project stakeholders</span></li>\n                <li style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);padding:5px 0;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;\"><span style=\"color:#c8102e;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\">●</span><span>AREMA, AASHTO &amp; industry-standard calculations</span></li>\n                <li style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);padding:5px 0;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;\"><span style=\"color:#c8102e;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\">●</span><span>US &amp; metric units — cloud-based &amp; collaborative</span></li>","content_type":"text","element_id":"bpro-promo-list"},{"content_value":"<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 1, 1); font-size: 21px; font-weight: bold;\">HOW WE WORK</span>","content_type":"text","element_id":"work-header"},{"content_value":"Baselok<sup>&reg;</sup> manufactures High-Performance Geosynthetics Tailored for Subgrade Reinforcement, Environmental Containment, and Structural Load Distribution.","content_type":"text","element_id":"intro-desc"},{"content_value":"&